01:22:00.477 --> 01:22:01.944
So, how's it going?


01:22:03.079 --> 01:22:05.314
Pretty fucking hard,
actually.


01:22:06.216 --> 01:22:07.483
Yeah?


01:22:07.485 --> 01:22:09.385
Yeah, I had to
move back in
with my dad.


01:22:10.453 --> 01:22:12.121
Hmm.
It's,


01:22:12.355 --> 01:22:13.656
It's been all right.


01:22:14.224 --> 01:22:15.624
He, um,


01:22:16.660 --> 01:22:18.928
he really loves
being a grandpa.


01:22:20.230 --> 01:22:21.597
Well, that's great.


01:22:27.037 --> 01:22:28.304
So, how about you?


01:22:29.706 --> 01:22:31.073
Me?


01:22:31.408 --> 01:22:32.675
Um,


01:22:35.345 --> 01:22:37.446
I'm considering
my options.


01:22:42.652 --> 01:22:44.720
It's going to be
one lucky kid.


01:22:45.555 --> 01:22:47.156
(BABY COOING)


01:22:47.958 --> 01:22:49.058
Hey.


01:22:49.060 --> 01:22:53.028
I really should
get him home
for his nap, so.


01:22:53.997 --> 01:22:55.230
Well, we're
going that way.


01:23:00.437 --> 01:23:01.603
Come on, Joyce.


01:23:02.205 --> 01:23:03.272
Come on.


01:23:03.606 --> 01:23:04.707
Let's go visit.


01:23:07.143 --> 01:23:08.610
Are you
okay there?
Yeah.


01:23:08.612 --> 01:23:10.012
Okay.


01:23:10.146 --> 01:23:11.213
Good dog.


01:23:12.182 --> 01:23:13.482
So, um.


01:23:14.284 --> 01:23:15.985
ANDIE: Is Justin
legal yet?


01:23:15.987 --> 01:23:17.252
(LIZZIE LAUGHS)


01:23:18.488 --> 01:23:20.723
He's got another
couple of weeks.
ANDIE: Yeah?


01:23:21.157 --> 01:23:22.658
Send him
my way.
I will.


01:23:22.660 --> 01:23:24.626
His French
is very, very good.


01:23:25.528 --> 01:23:27.363
Getting better
all the time.


01:23:27.365 --> 01:23:29.164
Action's a little
slow these days.


01:23:29.166 --> 01:23:31.200
I'm happy to go
a little bit younger.


01:23:31.202 --> 01:23:33.335
Well, you gotta do
what you gotta do.


01:23:34.104 --> 01:23:36.205
You know,
I think my dad's
new girlfriend


01:23:36.207 --> 01:23:37.773
is actually younger
than Justin.


01:23:38.308 --> 01:23:39.475
Oh, my God.


01:23:40.444 --> 01:23:43.779
Do you know
that they actually have
a kid on the way?


01:23:43.781 --> 01:23:45.280
(GASPING) No way.


01:23:45.282 --> 01:23:51.120
No, really. It's weird,
because I don't know if she's
sure how babies get made.

